<title>HUNGARY: Hungary 1-mo BUBOR rate 21.60 pct, 3-mo 21.58 pct.</title>
<headline>Hungary 1-mo BUBOR rate 21.60 pct, 3-mo 21.58 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungary's Budapest Interbank Offered Rate (BUBOR) eased for both the one- and the three-month maturities, the National Bank of Hungary (NBH) said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The one-month rate was fixed at 21.60 percent, down from 21.99 percent. The three-month rate was 21.58 percent, down from 21.74 percent, the NBH said.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327 4040</p>
</text>
